This is the Season Research Lab.{VAR BE01}
Twist Mountain, just beyond Mistralton,
has snow, depending on the season.

We research changes in nature that
occur due to the seasons.{VAR BE01}
Consider the Pokémon called {VAR 0101 0000},
which lives in this forest.{VAR BE01}
Its appearance is said to change
according to the season.{VAR BE01}
This characteristic is of great interest
to us.{VAR BE01}
We want to research this Pokémon and
observe its seasonal changes.{VAR BE01}
That's why we developed a marvelous
climate-control system that transcends{VAR BE00}
the seasons and allows us to freely{VAR BE00}
adjust temperature and humidity!{VAR BE01}

Up to this point, everything has been
fine...but we are very busy, and we{VAR BE00}
haven't really had a chance to catch{VAR BE00}
many {VAR 0101 0000} to study.{VAR BE01}
So, this is what we would like to ask you.
First, please capture a {VAR 0101 0000}.{VAR BE01}
Then, when its appearance changes,
could you bring it back to the lab?{VAR BE01}
Then, when we've confirmed the change to
the {VAR 0101 0000} you bring us, we will also{VAR BE00}
go search for that season's {VAR 0101 0000}.{VAR BE01}

How about it?{VAR BE01}
If you don't mind, would you please show
us what {VAR 0101 0000} looks like now?

{VAR 0101 0000}'s Spring Form!{VAR BE01}
The luster of its body and its coloring is
like a flower field in the spring!{VAR BE01}
The scent emanating from it is also
very floral.{VAR BE01}
Thank you so much! I want to go catch
my own {VAR 0101 0000} right away!

{VAR 0101 0000}'s Summer Form!{VAR BE01}
The luster of its body and its coloring
is like a thicket in summer!{VAR BE01}
The scent emanating from it is also
very fresh and green.{VAR BE01}
Thank you so much! I want to go catch
my own {VAR 0101 0000} right away!

{VAR 0101 0000}'s Autumn Form!{VAR BE01}
The luster of its body and its coloring
is like a tree-lined road with falling{VAR BE00}
leaves dancing down!{VAR BE01}
The scent emanating from it is also
like dry leaves.{VAR BE01}
Thank you so much! I want to go catch
my own {VAR 0101 0000} right away!

{VAR 0101 0000}'s Winter Form.{VAR BE01}
The luster of its body and its coloring
is like the slope of a mountain!{VAR BE01}
The scent emanating from it
is also like fresh snow.{VAR BE01}
Thank you so much! I want to go catch
my own {VAR 0101 0000} right away!

Thank you very much!{VAR BE01}
But we've already caught
that Form of {VAR 0101 0000}.

Oh, I see.{VAR BE01}
We would be really grateful if you could
assist us with our research, but if{VAR BE00}
you're too busy...

Oh! It's you!{VAR BE01}
Thanks to you, we've caught all of
the Forms of {VAR 0101 0000}.{VAR BE01}
Now we can thoroughly study the
relationship between Pokémon, seasons,{VAR BE00}
and climate.{VAR BE01}
Thank you very much.
It isn't much, but please accept this.{VAR BE01}

This is the only place in the world where
you can see {VAR 0101 0000}'s four seasonal{VAR BE00}
Forms all at one time.{VAR BE01}
They've kind of become our mascots!

The temperature and humidity
inside the case next to me{VAR BE00}
